--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Maintained by IANA under BCP 47 / RFC 5646.
IANA and the IETF state that the Protocol Registries may be freely used by any
party for any purpose. https://www.iana.org/help/licensing-terms

Embedded: the registered language subtags and their ISO 639 pairings.

