--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Published by SIX Financial Information AG in its capacity as the ISO 4217
maintenance agency, which states that it makes the code lists available online
and free of charge.
https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/financial-information/data-standards.html

Embedded: current currency, fund and precious-metal codes; withdrawn codes and
the dates of their withdrawal.

